{"4542120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Neurospasm", "steam_appid": 4542120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A First Person Roguelike Horde Shooter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill hordes of weird fleshy enemies, using lots of weapons, and active abilities that you power up by getting kills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542120/extras/cfc5b644a27f4cf9fdd0dfeb87ff55f7.poster.avif?t=1782117459\" width=852 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542120/extras/cfc5b644a27f4cf9fdd0dfeb87ff55f7.webm?t=1782117459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542120/extras/cfc5b644a27f4cf9fdd0dfeb87ff55f7.mp4?t=1782117459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect and Stack 80+ Unique items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each item can change your weapons and bullets, change your stats, add passive abilities, or spawn buddies that help you in some way. And the best part, every item can stack, making them more and more powerful</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542120/extras/333a16ce9ec71482bd9aeadf93c125c5.poster.avif?t=1782117459\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542120/extras/333a16ce9ec71482bd9aeadf93c125c5.webm?t=1782117459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542120/extras/333a16ce9ec71482bd9aeadf93c125c5.mp4?t=1782117459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ascend through the Pyramid</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through 5 layers, all with their own styles, enemies, and unique mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542120/extras/876924109f35c9937bca98a382daf115.poster.avif?t=1782117459\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542120/extras/876924109f35c9937bca98a382daf115.webm?t=1782117459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542120/extras/876924109f35c9937bca98a382daf115.mp4?t=1782117459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fully procedular maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The layers of the pyramid all have a consistent theme, but the layout changes every time you visit them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542120/extras/fd1484a2ab9f525f1dde48290e845d26.avif?t=1782117459\" width=1406 height=494 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Yourself</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money based on how well you do, then spend it between runs, upgrading yourself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542120/extras/f1d0aaf8920356a8b4eb7a457a30af88.avif?t=1782117459\" width=1430 height=802 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Events</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make runs even more interesting, random events can happen which alter how entire layers play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=